        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7059, Rope Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7-1/2 Inch Rope Sideplate is a great addition to any traditional home. This classic interior door set is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. Choose from a huge selection of time-honored knobs and levers including matching rope knob or rope lever. This Rope Sideplate will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 7-1/2 Inch Rope Door Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim and sideplate.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Rope 7-1/2 Inch Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7059-specifications.pdf?v=1704262382\"><b>Emtek 7059 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs / levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior sideplate. Turning inside knob / lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7990-finish.jpg?v=1704354653\" width=\"431\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 7059 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
